Z||000001||N_Man||06-22-2000||12:51 AM||||welcome darren <BR>I, Fierosound, and a few others here are from calgary.  We have a club that just started up.  check out <A HREF="HTTP://www.geocities.com/calgaryfieros" TARGET=_blank>HTTP://www.geocities.com/calgaryfieros</A> <P>All of what you ask depend if your going to do the work yourself or pay someone to do it.<P>I do all my work myself usually get my stuff from a place called superior automtive supply.  Mopac is the biggest performance shop in town.  <P>If you want someone to work on it for you Im the wrong guy to ask.||||reg||1
